# Optional. No AI client is enabled when unset.
# /api/ai, recommended: the daemons relay the assistant to the agent their cluster
# configuration names (listener.ai_agent_url), from the origin of this webapp; the
# entry shows on the clusters that have one, for an OpenID session.
# Or the HTTPS origin of the agent, no trailing path, with this webapp's origin in
# OPENSVC_AI_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS on the agent.
VITE_AI_AGENT_URL=/api/ai
